           sor addressing with _r_o_w first, but the original developers  of  the
           _t_e_r_m_c_a_p  interface  chose  to put the _c_o_l (column) parameter first.
           The ttggoottoo function swaps the order of its parameters.  It does this
           even  for  calls  requiring only a single parameter.  In that case,
